pool VP_DOLINES_FRESH
  p.kind dolines
  g.any.any clean
  g.any.hi clean & trust>=25
  t.1 *Checks the clean hands once more*
  t.2 *Turns one hand then the other*
  t.3 *Studies the clean palms for a moment*
  t.4 *Studies the pale marks where the dirt was*
  t.5 *Runs a thumb over a washed knuckle*
  t.6 *Touches a clean fingertip with the opposite thumb*
  t.7 *Looks at a wrist then lowers both hands*
  t.8 *Offers a hand then glances down at its clean palm*
  t.9 *Lets the player see a small smile before looking away*
  t.10 *Shifts a little closer without raising the voice*
